### Say:

"I would measure this solution in two dimensions.

First: **business value.**

Are we improving conversion, revenue and campaign efficiency?

Second: **control.**

Are we preventing unauthorized actions and maintaining a complete audit trail?"

---

# 19:00–20:00 — Closing

### Say:

"So let me summarize the demo in four steps.

**One — AI predicts.**

It identifies the customers most likely to respond.

**Two — Governance checks.**

It verifies identity, data permissions, policy and consent.

**Three — Humans handle risk.**

Higher-risk decisions can require approval.

**Four — Everything is recorded.**

The organization has an audit trail for every important decision."

### Final message:

> **AI identifies the opportunity.**
>
> **Governance permits the action.**
>
> **Human approval handles elevated risk.**
>
> **Audit makes the decision explainable.**

### Final KPI statement:

"The goal is not simply to deploy AI.

The goal is to increase business value while keeping AI actions controlled, measurable and explainable."

### Closing line:

**"This is governed automation — not autonomous marketing."**

The source uses this same distinction as its final operating model. 

